Map (You are '@' at center):                                   
    . . T . .                                                      
    # . @ w w                                                      
    . . . . w                                                      
                                                                   
    Legend:                                                        
    . = Grass (Walkable)                                           
    # = Chest (Walkable, Actions: Open, Store)
    T = Tree (Actions: Choppable)                                  
    w = Water (Impassable)                                          

